  "content": "<h4>自 FTB Chunks 1902.4.0 起，若您想讓 KubeJS、FTB Ranks / Luckperms、Waystones、Game Stages 與 FTB Chunks 整合，需使用 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a>。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這是一個能讓您宣告區塊以保護方塊的模組，同時也內建小地圖與大地圖功能！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在地圖任意處按下滑鼠右鍵即可建立路徑點。</p><p>對路徑點或死亡點按右鍵可編輯或刪除。</p><p>點選「已宣告區塊」按鈕後，在地圖上按左鍵或右鍵選取歸屬於您的區塊。對已宣告區塊按 Shift+左鍵或右鍵可切換強制載入。</p><p>透過「盟友」按鈕將其他玩家加入為盟友，允許他們與您的區塊互動。（近期已變更，更新將隨後推出）</p><p>若對方也將您設為盟友，便能彼此共享地圖資料。</p><p>&nbsp;\n<img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/K5sXkH.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/tZp_4N.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/bNT8Q9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/5W2MKd.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2>掌握最新資訊</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
